      "writtenOn": "2022-03-23T23:38:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you\u0027re finding yourself manually implementing Future, and you\u0027re not writing a new async feature, that should be a red flag - in this case, specifically that you should probably just have each of your \"procedures\" have a message queue rather than all competing to yank packets out of a central cell.",
