      "writtenOn": "2022-03-23T23:38:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, if I\u0027m reading this right you:\n1. Convert each expression into a repeated wait on that future, as a future.\n2. You create a future which will poll all of the sub-futures in a loop, assuming they can\u0027t terminate since they\u0027re in a loop.\n3. You wait on that future.\n\nIf that\u0027s correct, I think this obfuscates relative to just doing\n```\njoin! (\n  async { loop { authentication::initiate(\u0026ctx).await } },\n  async { loop { authentication::respond(\u0026ctx).await } },\n  ...\n);\n```",
      "revId": "7823b3a924c0dcc29ca9d28e832fa1aa062d3f97",
